# Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth: "Each land is a Forest in addition to its other land types."
#
# "Each land" is every land on the battlefield, whoever controls it: Bot2's Island is an Island Forest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {G}.)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Forest; Island
Bot2.Mana = {G}
